                                "sense_id": "9d8d6f74-8c05-34bf-8305-a0e48891c605",
                                "text": "It was on the plane to Togo, six months earlier, back when Togo was still on the shortlist, before Aimee had offended that tiny nation by suggesting, in an interview, that its government did ‘nothing for their people’."
